# Shell scripts must be LF on every checkout. A Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true otherwise writes them as CRLF, and deploy/build-and-upload.sh
# rsyncs the working copy as-is — which put a CRLF backup.sh on the Hostinger
# host, where `set -o pipefail\r` fails and no backup was ever written.
# JS/JSON are left to autocrlf: Node reads either ending.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
